From: Luanti WS Proxy Patch Set
Subject: Embed WebSocket proxy for minetest-wasm browser client support
Description:
  This patch adds an embedded WebSocket proxy (uWebSockets) to the Luanti
  server, enabling browser-based minetest-wasm clients to connect and play.
  It includes shared-queue direct MTP injection (no UDP loopback) and
  proper IPv6 X-Forwarded-For address handling.

  Applies to: Luanti 5.16.1 (tag: 5ebd9b5)
  Repository: https://github.com/luanti-org/luanti
  Based on 3 squashed commits:
    404bd22 feat: embed WebSocket proxy (uWebSockets) for minetest-wasm clients
    60000eb ws_proxy: shared-queue direct injection (no UDP loopback)
    8e5ee0a ws_proxy: handle IPv6 X-Forwarded-For addresses

Usage:
  git clone https://github.com/luanti-org/luanti
  cd luanti
  git checkout 5.16.1
  git apply /path/to/ws_proxy.patch

  Or apply on a detached HEAD at the tag:
  git checkout 5ebd9b5
  git apply /path/to/ws_proxy.patch

Files changed (9 files, +486/-8):
  src/CMakeLists.txt          |  29 +++++
  src/defaultsettings.cpp     |   5 +
  src/network/mtp/impl.h      |   7 +
  src/network/mtp/threads.cpp |  56 ++++++--
  src/network/socket.h        |   1 +
  src/network/ws_proxy.cpp    | 310 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
  src/network/ws_proxy.h      |  55 ++++++++
  src/server.cpp              |  26 ++++
  src/server.h                |   5 +

Build:
  mkdir build && cd build
  cmake .. -DBUILD_SERVER=ON -DBUILD_CLIENT=OFF
  make -j$(nproc)

Configuration (luanti.conf):
  ws_port = 8888
  ws_bind_address = 127.0.0.1
  ws_dns_ip = 1.1.1.1

